### Create
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write API tests",
  "description": "Jest + Supertest",
  "priority": "high"
}

### List
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?status=todo

### Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?page=1&limit=10

### Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/stats

### Complete
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/PUT_ID_HERE/complete

### Assign
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/PUT_ID_HERE/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignee": "Shubham Kumar"
}

### Update
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/PUT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "priority": "medium"
}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/PUT_ID_HERE
